{title: Chinna Chinna Thooral}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja Balasubramaniam}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
Chinna [C] chinna thooral [Fm] enna,        Ennai [C] konjum saaral [Fm] enna
Sinda [C#] chinda aaval pin [C] na,        Nenjil [C#] pongum paadal e [C] nna
[Fm] Chinna [C] chinna,        [Fm] Unadhu thooralum iniya saaralum
[C] theendum [Fm] maegam [C] silirkkuthama,        [G#] NaNaindha pozhidinil kuLirndha manadinil
[G] Yedho aasai [Fm] thudikkudam [G] ma,        [G#] Manidha jaadiyin pasiyum dhaagamum
[G] Unnaal endrum [Fm] theerumam [G] ma,        [G] Vaarithantha [Fm] vaLLal endruuu
[G] Paaril unnai [Fm] solvadhundu,        [Fm] Inamum kulamum irukkum ulagil
[G#] anaivarum ingu [Fm] sari samamena,        [G#] uNarthidum mazha [Fm] yae
